'''Knuckles''' (ナックルズ, ''Nakkuruzu'', '''Knuckles''') is a [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] enemy that appears in the [[Sonic the Hedgehog Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 14.4 Update|Version 14.4]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Knuckles
|image = E 732.png
|first appearance = [[Sonic the Hedgehog Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 2,000¢ - 7,900¢
}}

==Enemy==
Knuckles has fairly high range for a Red enemy, standing at 350 range with an [[Omni Strike]] going all the way to 380. While his damage and health aren't that impressive, they can greatly escalate at higher magnifications where he becomes untouchable to anything that does not outrange him as he pummels everything in his way. His [[Immune to Waves|Immunity to Waves]] and [[Immune to Weaken|Weaken]] further add to the threat he poses, as he can quickly devastate clusters of units, enabling either himself or the nasty enemies backed by him to quickly punch through the frontline and reach whatever's behind.

==Strategy==
Despite his combination of stats and abilities, Knuckles isn't much different from the average midranger, and is best fought from a distance while a stream of meatshields keep him occupied.

As much as [[Weaken]] and [[Wave Attack|Waves]] are useless against him, his Red trait is still easily much exploitable by other specialists, though an opening may have to be created artificially through the use of the [[Ototo Corps#Thunderbolt|Thunderbolt Cannon]].

